929	 * process from the web app (nxeon-worker.service vs nxeon-web.service), so an
930	 * in-memory signal (like lib/chat-bot-step.ts's TTL map, which works because the
931	 * chat bot and the poll route share one process) is not visible here — the signal
932	 * has to be durable. `HostingAccount.provisioningStep` / `Server.provisioningStep`
