939	 * going ACTIVE: a one-click app install (WordPress, etc.) queued at order time
940	 * runs as a `HostingTask` AFTER the account is active, and that queue already has
941	 * genuine DB-persisted status transitions (PENDING → RUNNING → DONE/FAILED) — no
942	 * new instrumentation needed there, just a kind → label mapping.
