373	 *
374	 * Deliberately not persisted: prisma/schema.prisma has no column for a raw
375	 * per-VM counter, and the two obvious substitutes are worse than a cold start —
376	 * the `Setting` KV is handed wholesale to the admin settings page (it would ship
377	 * a blob of every server's counters to the browser), and reusing
378	 * `abuseBwMark` would break the abuse window it exists for. A worker restart
379	 * therefore loses the baseline; `backfillGap` recovers the interval from RRD so
380	 * the restart costs at most the newest (still-filling) RRD bucket instead of a
381	 * whole sweep interval.
