1193	/**
1194	 * The single shared audit-log writer. Extracted verbatim (same body, same
1195	 * impersonation-attribution logic) from what was a private, unexported
1196	 * `audit()` in lib/actions.ts used by only ~19 call sites in that one file —
1197	 * every other lib/actions-*.ts module wrote `db.auditLog.create(...)` ad hoc,
1198	 * so coverage of "what did staff actually do" was inconsistent by
1199	 * construction. New staff-reachable modules (lib/actions-work.ts,
1200	 * lib/actions-staff.ts's grant/IP changes) call this directly so an
1201	 * EMPLOYEE's activity is captured with the same discipline as everything
1202	 * else, from day one.
