427	/**
428	 * What "Renew now" costs and how long it buys — for the BUTTON that quotes it.
429	 *
430	 * This is a presentation wrapper over `renewalCharge` (lib/stripe-cards.ts) and
431	 * deliberately owns no arithmetic of its own. It exists only to add the duration
432	 * phrasing the UI needs.
