424	/** What an abandoned migration is told, in the customer's words. */
425	const ABANDONED_MIGRATION_ERROR =
426	  "This migration stopped before it finished — the transfer was interrupted and nothing was left running that could pick it up. " +
427	  "Nothing on your old server was changed at any point, so it is still serving exactly as it was. Start the migration again when you're ready.";
